   316→### 字符串优化
   317→
   318→```csharp
   319→// ✅ 正确：使用 StringBuilder 或字符串缓存
   320→private static readonly StringBuilder _sb = new StringBuilder();
   321→private const string SCORE_PREFIX = "Score: ";
   322→
   323→public void UpdateScoreDisplay(int score)
   324→{
